===================

Create Gitignore               | touch .gitignore
Ignore log files               | *.log
Ignore environment file        | .env
Ignore Node modules            | node_modules/
Ignore Terraform state         | *.tfstate
Remove tracked file            | git rm --cached .env


TOPIC 21: GIT DIFF
==================

View changes                   | git diff
View staged changes             | git diff --cached
Compare branches              | git diff main feature
Compare commits               | git diff HEAD~1 HEAD


TOPIC 22: GIT CHERRY-PICK
=========================

Apply commit                   | git cherry-pick <commit-id>
Continue cherry-pick           | git cherry-pick --continue
Abort cherry-pick              | git cherry-pick --abort


TOPIC 23: GIT BLAME
===================

Check who changed lines        | git blame file.txt
Check specific lines           | git blame -L 10,20 file.txt


TOPIC 24: GIT CLEAN
===================

Preview untracked files        | git clean -n
Delete untracked files         | git clean -f
Delete untracked directories   | git clean -fd


TOPIC 25: GIT CLONE
===================

Clone repository               | git clone <URL>
Clone specific branch          | git clone -b develop <URL>
Shallow clone                  | git clone --depth 1 <URL>


TOPIC 26: GIT REFLOG
====================

View reflog                    | git reflog
Find lost commit               | git reflog
Recover commit                 | git switch -c recovery <commit-id>


TOPIC 27: GIT SSH
=================

Generate SSH key               | ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -C "email@example.com"
